    "source": "PB Q337",
    "bookKeyCorrected": false
  },
  {
    "number": 3,
    "question": "In UDP, the user datagrams are not",
    "options": [
      {
        "letter": "a",
        "text": "Channeled"
      },
      {
        "letter": "b",
        "text": "Transformed"
      },
      {
        "letter": "c",
        "text": "Numbered"
      },
      {
        "letter": "d",
        "text": "Addressed"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "c",
    "explanation": "UDP has no sequence numbers, so datagrams are **not numbered**.",
    "source": "PB Q339",
    "bookKeyCorrected": false
  },
  {
    "number": 4,
    "question": "Beyond IP, UDP provides additional services such as",
    "options": [
